+# Spec Delta
+
+## Purpose
+
+Defines the shipping cost of an order and when shipping is free.
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Shipping is free from €50.00 of goods
+Shipping SHALL be free when the goods come to 5000 cents (€50.00) or more, after every discount and before VAT. Otherwise it SHALL be priced by parcel weight: up to 1 kg €4.90, up to 5 kg €8.90, up to 20 kg €14.90, heavier €29.90.
+
+#### Scenario: Exactly €50.00
+- **WHEN** the goods after discounts come to 5000 cents and the parcel weighs 500 g
+- **THEN** shipping is 0 cents
+
+#### Scenario: One cent below
+- **WHEN** the goods after discounts come to 4999 cents and the parcel weighs 500 g
+- **THEN** shipping is 490 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Discounted basket reaching €50.00
+- **WHEN** an order's lines total 5500 cents gross and discounts bring the goods to exactly 5000 cents
+- **THEN** shipping is 0 cents
