+
+## 2. Free shipping threshold
+
+- [x] 2.1 Change `shippingCost` in `src/shipping.ts` to free at goods >= 5000; add tests in `test/orders.test.ts` for goods of 4999 (shipping paid) and 5000 (free), including a discounted order landing exactly on 5000; verify with `npm test`
+
+## 3. VAT rounding
+
