+# vat Specification
+
+## Purpose
+Defines how VAT on order lines is computed and rounded.
+
+## Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Line VAT rounds half up to the cent
+VAT SHALL be computed per line on the line's net amount after every discount, at the rate of its VAT class (standard 22%, reduced 10%, super-reduced 4%, exempt 0%), in integer cents, rounded half up on each line.
